  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2021-04-13T10:47:10.461Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "If i make an avatar public, it's because i want people to use it.  I shouldn't have to make a world or show them the avatar in person for them to be able to clone it.  If i don't want others to clone it i set it private.  That's the whole point of that system.\n\nAs someone who intends to make a number of public avatars in the future, i dislike this limitation.",
